WEBVTT

00:00:04.000 --> 00:00:09.995
An agent can finish a step, pause for another approval,
and accidentally repeat work that already finished.

00:00:10.215 --> 00:00:14.247
LangGraph 1.2.16 fixes several resume bugs.

00:00:14.467 --> 00:00:18.968
We ran thirteen selected upstream regression cases
against both versions.

00:00:19.188 --> 00:00:22.921
The earlier version passed three. The new version
passed all thirteen.

00:00:23.141 --> 00:00:26.235
These are local workflow tests, with no model calls.

00:00:26.455 --> 00:00:31.233
One important lesson is that a correct final state can
hide repeated actions.

00:00:31.453 --> 00:00:35.379
Record how often each action runs, as well as the final
result.

00:00:35.599 --> 00:00:39.417
The update also fixes duplicated state updates during
resume.

00:00:39.637 --> 00:00:45.077
But an interrupted node still starts again from the
beginning. Work before its pause can run again.

00:00:45.297 --> 00:00:47.665
Keep each external action safe to repeat.

00:00:47.885 --> 00:00:52.792
Use a stable operation key, and test your actual
checkpoint store before deployment.
